Scotland Yard station data
--------------------------
src/games/scotland-yard/data/stations.ts is adapted from
GameInitializer/resources/stations.json in the project "ScotlandYard"
https://github.com/tim-koehler/ScotlandYard
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Changes made: converted from JSON to TypeScript, placeholder station 0 removed,
two one-way taxi links made two-way, the three ferry links added, positions
rescaled into this project's own map space.

Only the station graph (which stations are linked by taxi, bus and underground,
and where they sit on the map) is used. The board artwork of the original game
is not included; this project draws its own map (see tools/map). The outlines of the river and the larger parks in that drawing were traced from a published illustrated map of central London so the geography is right; none of its artwork is used.

